    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">GST Details:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Each item should have a corresponding GST rate and amount, ensuring proper taxation and compliance.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Total Breakdown:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The invoice should display the total amount including GST, as well as the individual components of GST (CGST, SGST, IGST).</p>
  </div>
</div>

	<p>To ensure smooth operations and avoid potential issues during corporate tax audits, packers and movers companies should obtain and display IBA (Indian Banks Association) approved certificates.</p>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>IBA Membership:</strong> The company should be a member of the IBA, signifying adherence to certain standards and guidelines.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Regular Updates:</strong> The certificates should be updated regularly (e.g., annually) to reflect the company's compliance status.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Easy Access:</strong> The certificates should be prominently displayed either online or physically at the company's premises to facilitate easy access during tax audits.</span></li>
	</ul>

	<p>To protect the clients and the company in case of any loss or damage during transportation, comprehensive transit insurance is essential.</p>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Insurance Provider:</strong> The company should collaborate with a reputable insurance provider to ensure reliable claim processing.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Coverage Details:</strong> The insurance policy should cover not only physical damage but also potential losses during transit.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Claim Process:</strong> The company should provide a clear and efficient claim process, ensuring timely resolution for clients in case of any incident.</span></li>
	</ul>

	<p>By adhering to these guidelines, packers and movers companies in Jaipur can ensure seamless operations and avoid potential legal or financial issues in the future.</p>
	<p>Providing comprehensive itemized invoices, maintaining IBA membership, and offering comprehensive transit insurance will contribute to a trusted reputation among clients and contribute to a safer, stress-free relocation experience.</p>

	<p>Remember, corporate tax audits are common in India, so having up-to-date IBA certificates on hand will be beneficial during such audits. Additionally, providing itemized invoices ensures transparency and helps minimize disputes.</p>
	<p>Offering comprehensive transit insurance ensures both the company and its clients are adequately protected. This insurance covers not only physical damage but also potential losses during transportation.</p></div>
